@startuml UC1_Request_Health_Data
!theme plain
title C4 Level 4 — Code Diagram: UC1 Request Health Data (Example: HL7)

package "iHOMIS Portal (React/Next.js)" {
    class RequestPage {
        + handleSubmit()
    }
    class "POST /api/request" as iHOMISRequestAPI <<Route Handler>> {
        + POST(req: Request)
    }
}

package "ADAPT iPaaS Middleware (Golang)" {
    class RequestHandler <<struct>> {
        + mongoRepo: MongoDBRepository
        + HandleRequest(w: ResponseWriter, r: Request)
    }
    class MongoDBRepository <<struct>> {
        + InsertTransaction(tx: Transaction): ObjectID
    }
}

package "WAH Hospital (React/Next.js)" {
    class "POST /api/requests" as WAHRequestsAPI <<Route Handler>> {
        + POST(req: Request)
    }
}

class "Clinician / Staff" as Clinician <<Actor>>

Clinician --> RequestPage : Fills and submits form
RequestPage --> iHOMISRequestAPI : fetch('/api/request')
iHOMISRequestAPI --> RequestHandler : HTTP POST /api/v1/request
RequestHandler --> MongoDBRepository : repo.InsertTransaction(tx)
RequestHandler --> WAHRequestsAPI : HTTP POST /requests
WAHRequestsAPI ..> RequestHandler : Returns 200 OK
RequestHandler ..> iHOMISRequestAPI : Returns {success:true, status:'PENDING'}

note right of RequestPage
  Form UI. Collects PhilHealth No., 
  patient name, reason.
end note

note right of iHOMISRequestAPI
  Validates form payload.
  Forwards to ADAPT iPaaS.
end note

note right of RequestHandler
  Determines direction (iHOMIS->WAH).
  Calls DB to insert PENDING transaction.
  Forwards request to WAH /api/requests.
end note

note right of MongoDBRepository
  Inserts new document into adapt_transaction_logs
  collection with status='PENDING', 
  source_format='HL7V2', destination_format='FHIR_R4'.
end note

note right of WAHRequestsAPI
  Receives forwarded request from ADAPT.
  Stores request_id in local WAH store.
  Notifies WAH inbox for review.
end note

@enduml
